<speak>Keeping just the portal and your notes open might make that session easier. When you've finished reading, you can close the document before moving to a different task, rather than leaving a row of open pages. If you download something for your records, check that you can find it in the folder you've chosen. You don't need to show it to me. And if you're using a shared household computer, keep your own documents within your own user space rather than leaving them on a common desktop.</speak>